 v2.0 will drop support for Python 2**: [Read more in the v2.0 Roadmap](https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/v2-roadmap.html)\r\n\r\n* Changed behavior of the default ``SSLContext`` when connecting to HTTPS proxy during HTTPS requests. The default ``SSLContext`` now sets ``check_hostname=True``.\r\n\r\n**If you or your organization rely on urllib3 consider supporting us via [GitHub Sponsors](https://github.com/sponsors/urllib3)**"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/36931501","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/36931501/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/36931501/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/releases/tag/1.26.3","id":36931501,"author":{"login":"sethmlarson","id":18519037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE5MDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18519037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson","html_url":"https://github.com/sethmlarson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"MDc6UmVsZWFzZTM2OTMxNTAx","tag_name":"1.26.3","target_commitish":"main","name":"1.26.3","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2021-01-26T18:53:41Z","updated_at":"2021-01-26T19:01:09Z","published_at":"2021-01-26T19:01:09Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/tarball/1.26.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/zipball/1.26.3","body":":warning: **IMPORTANT: urllib3 v2.0 will drop support for Python 2**: [Read more in the v2.0 Roadmap](https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/v2-roadmap.html)\r\n\r\n* Fixed bytes and string comparison issue with headers (Pull #2141)\r\n\r\n* Changed `ProxySchemeUnknown` error message to be more actionable if the user supplies a proxy URL without a scheme (Pull #2107)\r\n\r\n**If you or your organization rely on urllib3 consider supporting us via [GitHub Sponsors](https://github.com/sponsors/urllib3)**"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33881959","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33881959/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33881959/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/releases/tag/1.26.2","id":33881959,"author":{"login":"sethmlarson","id":18519037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE5MDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18519037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson","html_url":"https://github.com/sethmlarson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"MDc6UmVsZWFzZTMzODgxOTU5","tag_name":"1.26.2","target_commitish":"master","name":"1.26.2","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2020-11-12T22:12:40Z","updated_at":"2020-12-12T19:14:05Z","published_at":"2020-11-12T22:17:34Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/tarball/1.26.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/zipball/1.26.2","body":":warning: **IMPORTANT: urllib3 v2.0 will drop support for Python 2**: [Read more in the v2.0 Roadmap](https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/v2-roadmap.html)\r\n\r\n* Fixed an issue where ``wrap_socket`` and ``CERT_REQUIRED`` wouldn't be imported properly on Python 2.7.8 and earlier (Pull #2052)\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33823253","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33823253/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33823253/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/releases/tag/1.26.1","id":33823253,"author":{"login":"sethmlarson","id":18519037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE5MDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18519037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson","html_url":"https://github.com/sethmlarson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"MDc6UmVsZWFzZTMzODIzMjUz","tag_name":"1.26.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"1.26.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2020-11-11T20:19:53Z","updated_at":"2020-12-12T19:13:54Z","published_at":"2020-11-11T20:23:09Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/tarball/1.26.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/zipball/1.26.1","body":":warning: **IMPORTANT: urllib3 v2.0 will drop support for Python 2**: [Read more in the v2.0 Roadmap](https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/v2-roadmap.html)\r\n\r\n* Fixed an issue where two `User-Agent` headers would be sent if a `User-Agent` header key is passed as `bytes` (Pull #2047)"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33751446","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33751446/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/33751446/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/releases/tag/1.26.0","id":33751446,"author":{"login":"sethmlarson","id":18519037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE5MDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18519037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson","html_url":"https://github.com/sethmlarson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"MDc6UmVsZWFzZTMzNzUxNDQ2","tag_name":"1.26.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"1.26.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2020-11-10T19:50:47Z","updated_at":"2020-12-12T19:14:16Z","published_at":"2020-11-10T19:53:25Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/tarball/1.26.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/zipball/1.26.0","body":":warning: **IMPORTANT: urllib3 v2.0 will drop support for Python 2**: [Read more in the v2.0 Roadmap](https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/v2-roadmap.html)\r\n\r\n* Added support for HTTPS proxies contacting HTTPS servers (Pull #1923, Pull #1806)\r\n\r\n* Deprecated negotiating TLSv1 and TLSv1.1 by default. Users that\r\n  still wish to use TLS earlier than 1.2 without a deprecation warning\r\n  should opt-in explicitly by setting ``ssl_version=ssl.PROTOCOL_TLSv1_1`` (Pull #2002)\r\n  **Starting in urllib3 v2.0: Connections that receive a ``DeprecationWarning`` will fail**\r\n\r\n* Deprecated ``Retry`` options ``Retry.DEFAULT_METHOD_WHITELIST``, ``Retry.DEFAULT_REDIRECT_HEADERS_BLACKLIST``\r\n  and ``Retry(method_whitelist=...)`` in favor of ``Retry.DEFAULT_ALLOWED_METHODS``,\r\n  ``Retry.DEFAULT_REMOVE_HEADERS_ON_REDIRECT``, and ``Retry(allowed_methods=...)``\r\n  (Pull #2000) **Starting in urllib3 v2.0: Deprecated options will be removed**\r\n\r\n* Added default ``User-Agent`` header to every request (Pull #1750)\r\n\r\n* Added ``urllib3.util.SKIP_HEADER`` for skipping ``User-Agent``, ``Accept-Encoding``, \r\n  and ``Host`` headers from being automatically emitted with requests (Pull #2018)\r\n\r\n* Collapse ``transfer-encoding: chunked`` request data and framing into\r\n  the same ``socket.send()`` call (Pull #1906)\r\n\r\n* Send ``http/1.1`` ALPN identifier with every TLS handshake by default (Pull #1894)\r\n\r\n* Properly terminate SecureTransport connections when CA verification fails (Pull #1977)\r\n\r\n* Don't emit an ``SNIMissingWarning`` when passing ``server_hostname=None``\r\n  to SecureTransport (Pull #1903)\r\n\r\n* Disabled requesting TLSv1.2 session tickets as they weren't being used by urllib3 (Pull #1970)\r\n\r\n* Suppress ``BrokenPipeError`` when writing request body after the server\r\n  has closed the socket (Pull #1524)\r\n\r\n* Wrap ``ssl.SSLError`` that can be raised from reading a socket (e.g. \"bad MAC\")\r\n  into an ``urllib3.exceptions.SSLError`` (Pull #1939)"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/32766206","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/32766206/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/32766206/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/releases/tag/1.25.11","id":32766206,"author":{"login":"sethmlarson","id":18519037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE5MDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18519037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson","html_url":"https://github.com/sethmlarson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"MDc6UmVsZWFzZTMyNzY2MjA2","tag_name":"1.25.11","target_commitish":"master","name":"1.25.11","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2020-10-19T14:08:52Z","updated_at":"2020-10-19T16:32:25Z","published_at":"2020-10-19T16:32:25Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/tarball/1.25.11","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/zipball/1.25.11","body":"* Fix retry backoff time parsed from ``Retry-After`` header when given in the HTTP date format. The HTTP date was parsed as the local timezone rather than accounting for the timezone in the HTTP date (typically UTC) (#1932, #1935, #1938, #1949)\r\n\r\n* Fix issue where an error would be raised when the `SSLKEYLOGFILE` environment variable was set to the empty string. Now `SSLContext.keylog_file` is not set in this situation (#2016)"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/28834115","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/28834115/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/releases/28834115/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/releases/tag/1.25.10","id":28834115,"author":{"login":"sethmlarson","id":18519037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE5MDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18519037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson","html_url":"https://github.com/sethmlarson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https:/